      "title": "Yuksom & Sacred Waters",
      "narrative": "Begin in Yuksom, then visit the Khecheopalri Lake Viewpoint. See the Coronation Stone, explore the Sculpture Shed, break for lunch at Chamaita, and end at Kunchenjunga Waterfall."
    },
